<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Pal Park!\rThis where top-tier Hustlers who\nain’t satisfied with the Safari Zone\fcome to flex their homie-catchin’\ftechniques on their peers.\r...Oh?\rAre you maybe...\nAh, you {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rMy pops told me about you!\nWord is, you a hotshot Hustler!\rWe’d be honored if you’d\nenter our Catching Shows. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Pal Park!\rThis where top-tier Hustlers who\nain’t satisfied with the Safari Zone\fcome to flex their homie-catchin’\ftechniques on their peers.\r...Oh?\rAre you maybe...\nAh, you {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rMy pops told me about you!\nWord is, you a hotshot Hustler!\rWe’d be honored if you’d\nenter our Catching Shows. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yes! You in!\nLet’s not waste no time!\rLemme explain how Pal Park work.\nWhat should I explain? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pal Park is where you get\ntimed catchin’ six homies.\rYou get six special\nHood Balls for the challenge.\rHustlers enterin’ gotta\nbring the six homies that\fget caught.\rIf you don’t bring six\nhomies, you can’t enter\fthe Catching Show.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the start of the Catching Show,\nyou get six Park Balls.\rUse the Park Balls to catch the\nsix homies you brought.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Put a Game Boy Advance Pokémon\nRuby, Sapphire, Emerald, FireRed,\for LeafGreen in the Game Pak slot.\rSix of your caught homies\ncan move from the Game Pak to the\fDS Game Card when your DS is on\fand you pick “MIGRATE FROM...”\rHeads up, you can’t put a\nGBA Game Pak in a Nintendo DSi\fto migrate.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna jump in\na Catching Show now? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aww, that’s too bad.\rWell, just holla at me again\nif you wanna enter.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou came to enter\na Catching Show? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou came to enter\na Catching Show? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, here go your Park Balls!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nsix Park Balls.\rThe current record holder is\n{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} with {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points.\rAight, go on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rShow us some masterful\nhomie catchin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, here go your Park Balls!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nsix Park Balls.\rThe current record holder is\n{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} with {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points.\rAight, go on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rShow us some masterful\nhomie catchin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, hold up. You ain’t got enough\nhomies for a Catching Show.\rYou gotta stock us with six\nhomies to enter.\rMove some homies over\nfrom Hoenn or somewhere else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yes! You in!\nLet’s not waste no time!\rLemme explain how Pal Park work.\nWhat should I explain? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sorry you had to tap out.\nI’ll take back whatever Park Balls\fyou got left.\rNext time, stick around and catch\nall six homies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, your PC Boxes full. You\nain’t got room for six more homies.\rYou can’t keep ’em,\neven if you catch ’em.\rClear enough room in a PC Box and\ncome back for your Catching Show.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congrats!\nThat’s all six homies caught!\rThe crowd LOVED watchin’\nyour Catching Show.\rAight, let’s see your all-important\nscore from this show!\r...\n...\rCatching Points: {STRVAR_1 53, 0, 0}!\rTime Points: {STRVAR_1 53, 1, 0}!\rType Points: {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0}!\rThe total is...\r...\n...\r{STRVAR_1 53, 3, 0} points!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh! That’s a CRAZY record!\nProps to you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good! That’s a decent record.\nProps to you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna put all the caught\nhomies in PC Boxes? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Done!\nYour homies got boxed up.\rNow you gotta save the game.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, then it might be fun for you to\ngo for a even better score by\ftryin’ to catch these six again.\rIf you wanna do another Catching\nShow, just come see us!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you wanna do another Catching\nShow, come see us again!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Time for your prize!\nHere you go!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Do another Catching Show\nwith the same homies? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The current record holder is\n{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} with {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points.\fCan you top that?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You topped 2,000 points!\nYou earned this, then!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Keep workin’ on a higher\nscore!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You topped 2,500 points!\nYou earned this, then!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You topped 3,000 points!\nYou earned this, then!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You hit 3,500 points!\nYou earned this, then!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You set a INSANE record!\nAin’t nothin’ left to say!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Bag full.\nCome back later.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard Hustlers complain that\nrare homies take longer to show up.\rIs it easier to start with common\nhomies?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, me?\nNah, I never catch homies myself.\fBut I love watchin’ Catching Shows.\rI love seein’ Johto and Hoenn\nhomies especially.\rThe regions I ain’t never been to\nis so mysterious.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m so happy I wanna share\nit with you today.\rI gotta crown you with this...\nCrown.\rOh, before you get it twisted,\nit’s a Accessory for homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m so happy I wanna share\nit with you today.\rI feel like I gotta give you\nthis Tiara.\rOh, before you get it twisted,\nit’s a Accessory for homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m so happy I wanna share\nit with you today.\rTake this\n“Seafloor” Backdrop.\rTry it when you dress up\nyour homies with Accessories.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m so happy I wanna share\nit with you today.\rTake this\n“Underground” Backdrop.\rTry it when you dress up\nyour homies with Accessories.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m so happy I wanna share\nit with you today.\rTake this\n“Sky” Backdrop.\rTry it when you dress up\nyour homies with Accessories.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not only is there the Pokéathlon and\nthe Safari Zone, but also the\fBattle Frontier and the Pal Park...\rOther people out here goin’\nSO hard... How dreamy...\fThis region got my heart racin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I came to see {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s\nCatching Show...\rSheesh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You for real?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYour Catching Show was fire!\fI’mma be a Hustler like you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\nthere’s always next time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My son a big fan of yours,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\fAre you...that famous?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0516_T08R0201_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you wanna see rare homies,\nCatching Shows at the Pal Park is\fthe best!</language>
	</row>
</body>
